flowchart TD
    A[Inspect PDF page locally] --> B[Count Unicode letters/digits and useful words]
    A --> C[Measure non-mask raster placements]
    B --> D{Meaningful text?}
    C --> E[Largest single-image page coverage]
    D -- Yes --> F{Coverage at least 0.30?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Mixed]
    F -- No --> H[TextBased]
    D -- No --> I{Coverage at least 0.80?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Scanned]
    I -- No --> K{Any raster image?}
    K -- Yes --> L[ImageBased]
    K -- No --> M[Unknown]

    N[Meaningful text: at least 40 alphanumeric characters OR at least 8 useful words]:::note
    N -. versioned rule .-> D
    classDef note fill:#fff8dc,stroke:#8a6d1d,color:#111;

